# The linked Vercel project has dashboard/ as its configured monorepo root.
# Keep local CLI deployments from uploading the Minecraft/plugin/tooling tree.
/*
!dashboard

# Defense in depth: never upload local/build-time secrets even if Vercel's defaults change.
/dashboard/.env*
!/dashboard/.env.example
/dashboard/.next/
/dashboard/node_modules/
/dashboard/*.log
